    m_Alignment: 3
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'in the game you need to go through different difficulty levels playing
    as a dragon, you need to escape from the hands of enemies, for this you will
    need to collect bags of ashes while escaping and destroy your enemies along the
    way. For gold and enemies you get charges of dragon shots, and at the end of
    each level you will need to shoot at the gate and thereby escape, after each
    level you find yourself in the next level, it is the same as the last one, but
    increased in length and number of enemies, so the final number of gates increases
    with each level, so you will need to be attentive and careful, since the enemies
    do not just stand still, but shoot at you from a special cannon; just one hit
    guarantees you a loss, with every 2nd level you get 1 life, thanks to which you
    can live on it after a projectile hits you.

    Good luck in the game!'
